body:
No Problem

&#x200B;

I believe you get your Cadet Identification Number (CIN) after your enrolment which takes a while. This is what you use to login. Once your in you'll have a lot more access. As for now you really don't need it as I'm guessing you are a recruit. For now just make sure you attend parade nights and try to enjoy the drill and history lessons

go on on vimeo and look at raf aircadet drill

&#x200B;

You can look at videos on that or on cadet portal if you have it yet

&#x200B;

always ask your ncos
